{"4540600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Thumper Chess", "steam_appid": 4540600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🖥️ Modern Game Feel</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t just a board — it’s a fully realized game experience:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animated and responsive pieces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full camera control and flying movement</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌐 Online Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play against real opponents or AI in matches. Host games, join other's games, and compete in real time.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open games to the public or invite a friend</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for stable online play</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚡ Fast &amp; Fluid Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thumper Chess is designed to feel responsive and satisfying:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth piece movement and animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean, readable board interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for both quick matches and long sessions</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎯 Built for Competitive Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're learning or grinding to improve:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accurate move validation </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Host/Server-driven game logic with smooth client-side animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for future competitive features</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🖥️ Modern Game Feel</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t just a board — it’s a fully realized game experience:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animated and responsive pieces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full camera control and flying movement</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌐 Online Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play against real opponents or AI in matches. Host games, join other's games, and compete in real time.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open games to the public or invite a friend</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for stable online play</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚡ Fast &amp; Fluid Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thumper Chess is designed to feel responsive and satisfying:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth piece movement and animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean, readable board interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for both quick matches and long sessions</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎯 Built for Competitive Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're learning or grinding to improve:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accurate move validation </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Host/Server-driven game logic with smooth client-side animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for future competitive features</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Thumper Chess is a free to play chess game with basic animated pieces. Better looking and more fun chess sets, maps, animations, etc... are available in cheap DLC content.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540600/70aa1249608ed13c96225c4c850d614926594664/header.jpg?t=1786374426", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540600/9344f741c3fd3123a6eb62ad6d331819ffe7689f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786374426", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540600/9